{"4319210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dune Rancher", "steam_appid": 4319210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Vanquish the stealing intruders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't let the Desert Spirits steal your Moondust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get Moondust to get upgrades, weapons and tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boost your Moondust income &amp; Get robots to automate the process</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automate your income with machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">.. And get rare resources to win the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dune Rancher is a first-person clicker &amp; incremental game, where you build, manage and protect your very own ranch on a desert. The ’Moonwell’ is the core of your ranch, which provide resources. Use your resources to upgrade your base, purchase robots, items, weapons and tools. But be aware, the monsters are approaching: Protect your income against the intruders of the desert. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dune Rancher is a story of a lonely Moondust Digger who decides to start chasing his dreams of becoming a succesfull Dune Rancher. After searching months for an unoccupied Moonwell, he finally reaches the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the rancher life begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1777274144\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Vanquish the stealing intruders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't let the Desert Spirits steal your Moondust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/dc2dfefdec90666bdf9a467002281bf7.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get Moondust to get upgrades, weapons and tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boost your Moondust income &amp; Get robots to automate the process</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/24c41889370e7893f35d084d33217408.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automate your income with machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">.. And get rare resources to win the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/21bdbdf8d6f0fda17b1619968ca09494.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dune Rancher is a first-person clicker &amp; incremental game, where you build, manage and protect your very own ranch on a desert. The ’Moonwell’ is the core of your ranch, which provide resources. Use your resources to upgrade your base, purchase robots, items, weapons and tools. But be aware, the monsters are approaching: Protect your income against the intruders of the desert. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.poster.avif?t=1777274144\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.webm?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/eee675e20b3eeab02a1b49bcd64c2975.mp4?t=1777274144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dune Rancher is a story of a lonely Moondust Digger who decides to start chasing his dreams of becoming a succesfull Dune Rancher. After searching months for an unoccupied Moonwell, he finally reaches the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the rancher life begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1777274144\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dune Rancher is a first-person incremental Moondust collecting game where you hoard materials and keep them safe from stealing Desert Spirits. Use Moondust to buy weapons, tools and robots to boost and automate your income.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/3144bb353efd89e906d575b201509439425f669f/header.jpg?t=1777274144", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319210/73b4b1ce8db7a2ac478d0ee61559c422282f9b03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777274144", "capsule_